<title>NEW ZEALAND: Foreigners hold 61.9 pct of NZ govt securities.</title>
<headline>Foreigners hold 61.9 pct of NZ govt securities.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proportion of New Zealand government securities held by foreigners rose in April to 61.9 percent from 61.4 percent in March, the Reserve Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The main change was in government bonds where the offshore held proportion rose to 66.3 percent from 65.2 percent.</p>
</text>
